# Never bake input data into the image.  It is supplied at deploy time via
# --input-dir and bind-mounted read-only at /input.  Note that --input-dir is
# NOT sealed: the CLI ships a plain tar.gz and the host extracts it in the
# clear.  For confidential input use `tee-crafter seal-input` — see
# ../README.md#what---input-dir-actually-does--read-this-before-sending-real-data
input/
output
